meta {
  name: The practitioner's daily agenda
  type: http
  seq: 40
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/practitioners/me/agenda
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~date: 2026-10-05
}

docs {
  The doctor's day: confirmed appointments plus unexpired holds (labelled `held`), in
  start order, each with the offering (duration + price), the practice location, who
  the consultation is for (`patient.displayName` — self, managed dependent or linked
  dependent) and who booked it (`booker.displayName`).

  `date` is a calendar day in the practice timezone (Africa/Douala, UTC+1) and defaults
  to today. `meta.from` / `meta.to` echo the UTC window that day maps to.

  Requires the doctor/nurse role (403 otherwise); 404 when the user has no
  practitioner profile yet.
}
